    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26126" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-τροπή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>confusion, agitation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				27.104
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.16.4
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				42.2
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>fiasco, debâcle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				9.13.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>disgust,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				831.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.219
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. καὶ φόβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.41
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pity, sympathy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοῖς ἀδικοῦσι γίνεσθαι</span>
			<i>divert</i> them <i>from</i> wrongdoing, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.16.4
			</span></i>.</div>
